    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏlŭmella</span></b>  (in
		MSS. often <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cŏlum-nella</span></b> ),
			ae, f.
		dim.
		columna, columen, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a small column</i>, <i>a pillar</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 20, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">22,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Leg. 2, 26, 66</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Tusc.
				5, 23, 65</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 2,
			10</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The foot</i> or <i>pedestal of a
				catapult</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10,
			15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a pillar</i>, <i>support</i>, <i>prop</i> (cf.
			columen), Lucil. ap. Don. <i><span class="en">Ter. Phorm. 2, 1, 57</span></i>.</div>
